---
const home = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>页面走丢了 | Medium 编辑精选 · 中文翻译与发芽</title>
    <script is:inline>
      // GitHub Pages 项目站：未命中路径一律返回本页。缺 /medium-digest/ 前缀的
      // 外部 URL（如 /articles/<slug>/）自动补全前缀跳转，避免「子页面打不开」。
      (function () {
        var base = '/medium-digest';
        var p = location.pathname;
        if (p !== base && p.indexOf(base + '/') !== 0) {
          location.replace(base + p + location.search + location.hash);
        }
      })();
    </script>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: #f6f4ef;
        color: #26231d;
        font-family: "Songti SC", "Noto Serif SC", Georgia, serif;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .card { max-width: 30rem; }
      .code {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: #0f766e;
        margin: 0;
      }
      h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0.6rem 0 0.8rem; }
      p { line-height: 1.8; color: #5c5648; margin: 0 0 1.6rem; }
      a.home {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #0f766e;
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
      a.home:hover { background: #0d5f58; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="code">404</p>
      <h1>页面走丢了</h1>
      <p>
        你访问的地址不存在。若链接来自旧收藏或手动输入且缺少
        <code>/medium-digest/</code> 前缀，页面已自动帮你跳转到正确地址；
        若仍看到本页，说明该文章尚未发布或地址有误。
      </p>
      <a class="home" href={home}>回首页</a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
